Package: ibus
Version: @DEB_IBUS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ibus/ibus
Depends: libibus-1.0-5, dbus
Description: Intelligent Input Bus - daemon and data
 The IBus daemon, command line tool, component and keymap data, D-Bus
 services and GSettings schema. Built without GTK panels, XIM, engines and
 dictionaries; input engines can be added later.
